{"user": "Any takeaway for future endgames? Corner control still king this late?", "user_ts": "2026-08-12T21:48:06.490072+00:00", "assistant": "Yes \u2014 **corner control still matters a lot late**, but the endgame takeaway is more precise:\n\n- **Don\u2019t just grab max flips now.** Ask: *what legal moves does White get next?*\n- **Corners are permanent**, but sometimes letting White take one corner is okay if you gain a strong follow-up or force bad mobility.\n- **Mobility/tempo can beat raw disc count**: if your move leaves White with no good moves \u2014 or no legal move, forcing a pass \u2014 you can get consecutive plays.\n- **Stable edges matter**: once you got **a1 and h1**, the top row became locked and couldn\u2019t be flipped back.\n- In the last few moves, **count the final disc swing**, not the immediate flip count.\n\nYour final position was **Black 41\u201323**, so the key was not \u201cwin every corner,\u201d but **use corners + mobility to control the final sequence**.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-12T21:48:06.490072+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-12T21:48:11.490072+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "votes": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 1, "Solution Request": 3, "Common Ground Question": 2}, "confidence": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.3333333333333333, "Solution Request": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Knowledge Deficit Question", "Solution Request"], "llama": ["Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Positive Feedback"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Positive Feedback"], "votes